flowchart TD
  subgraph User
    A1[termina reunião] --> A2[escreve ata.md]
    A2 --> A3[roda /poc-from-minutes ata.md]
    Z1[cd dest && npm run dev] --> Z2[POC navegável]
  end
  subgraph Slash[Slash command orchestrator]
    A3 --> B1[AskUserQuestion: nome / dest / style-ref]
    B1 --> B2[exec didio-poc-from-minutes.sh]
  end
  subgraph Pipeline[bin/didio-poc-pipeline.py]
    B2 --> C1[parse_step]
    C1 --> C2[scaffold_step]
    C2 --> C3[mock_gen + ui_gen]
    C3 --> C4[style_step]
    C4 --> C5[install + smoke]
    C5 --> C6[git_init]
    C6 --> Z1
  end
  subgraph LLM[meeting-parser]
    C1 --> D1[lê ata]
    D1 --> D2[escreve manifest.json]
    D2 --> C2
  end
  C1 -->|manifest inválido| E4[exit 4: reescrever ata]
  C5 -->|npm install fail| E5[exit 5]
  C5 -->|HTTP ≠ 200| E6[exit 6: porta ocupada?]
  C6 -->|git fail| E7[exit 7]
